Efu_Text_Wake = Cold concrete.\nThe world outside is quiet.{be01}\nSomething stirs in the grey.{be01}
Efu_Text_BoardedDoor = Boarded shut from the inside.\nWhoever's in there isn't coming out.
Efu_Text_BedRest = A thin mattress on the concrete.\nRest for a while?
Efu_Text_BedRested = You slept with one eye on the door.{be01}\nYour Pokémon recovered a little.
Efu_Text_RaidDepart = Past this gate, nobody's coming\nto save you.{be01}\nAnything you carry out there\ncan be taken. So can you.{be01}\nHead out?
Efu_Text_Saving = Saving...\nDon't turn off the power.
Efu_Text_RaidReturn = You made it back. Alive, this time.{be01}
Efu_Text_RaidLost = You never made it back.{be01}\nEvery Pokémon you took out there\nis gone. Sold, or worse.{be01}
Efu_Text_LostSoul = A starving {0101:1} crept out of\nthe dark, as lost as you are.{be01}\nIt won't leave your side.{be01}
Efu_Text_Blackout = You stagger home, alone.{be01}\nThe Pokémon you left behind\nbelong to someone else now.{be01}
Efu_Text_ScavDrop = The scavenger ran for it, dropping\nsomething in the dirt.
Efu_Text_ScavDropLost = The scavenger ran off.
Efu_Text_TossLost = There was nowhere to put\n{ff00:2}{0109:0}{ff00:0} down. It's gone.
Efu_Text_NurseOffer = A full heal is a dollar per level.\nFor your team, ${0204:0}. Shall I?
Efu_Text_NurseDone = There. All patched up.\nCome back in one piece. Promise me.
Efu_Text_NurseBye = All right. I'll be here.\nI'm always here.
Efu_Text_NurseGreet = Welcome back. Still in one piece?
Efu_Text_NurseHeal = Heal
Efu_Text_Talk = Talk
Efu_Text_Leave = Leave
Efu_Text_NurseTalk = Most of my patients come in carried.{be01}\nThe ones who make it back on their\nown feet are the ones who ran.{be01}\nIf it goes wrong out there, drop\neverything and run.{be01}\nThings can be found again.\nYou can't.
Efu_Text_NotEnoughMoney = Oh... You don't have enough money.
Efu_Text_JoyOffer = I can heal your team for ${0204:0},\na dollar a level. Shall I?
Efu_Text_JoyJoin = You have a base by the sea?\nWith a Pokémon Center?{be01}\nThe slavers burned my last clinic.\nFor ${0204:0}, I'll move in. Deal?
Efu_Text_JoyJoined = A roof, and a door that locks...\nI'd almost forgotten.{be01}\nI'll see you at the counter.
Efu_Text_JoyStay = Then I'll stay out here a while.\nSomeone has to.
Efu_Text_JoyGreet = Oh! You're not a scavenger, are you?{be01}\nI'm a nurse. I patch up whoever\nstill crawls out of these woods.
Efu_Text_JoyTalk = The scavengers leave their hurt\nbehind. I go out after they've gone.{be01}\nWatch the bridges up north.\nSome days a fallen tree blocks one,\nor a boulder the other.{be01}\nThe path through the trees on the\nleft always gets you through.
Efu_Text_ClerkIntro = Oh! Someone's still here?{be01}\nWhen the evacuation came, the ships\nleft with the others.{be01}\nThe staff here went with them.\nBut not me. Where would I go?{be01}\nI can still source supplies, but\nnothing's cheap anymore.{be01}\nI'll buy whatever you drag back\nfrom out there to keep the stock up.{be01}\nI'll be at the counter.
Efu_Text_ClerkHintNurse = Word is there's a nurse holed up\nin the forest. Still treats people.{be01}\nThe slavers will find her soon.\nGet her somewhere safe, if you can.
Efu_Text_ClerkHintTinkerer = There's an inventor hiding out at\nFloccesy Ranch.{be01}\nIn the old lab behind the ranch\nhouse. Bring money. Lots of it.
Efu_Text_ClerkHintGuide = The old gate guide never came back.{be01}\nBurgh's bugs dragged them off to\nRumination Field.{be01}\nStill alive, last I heard.
Efu_Text_ClerkHintDayCare = The Day-Care Lady's still out on\nRoute 3, by the old childcare centre.{be01}\nA thug's squatting in it now.{be01}\nShe could use someone like you.
Efu_Text_ClerkHintHole = There's a hole in the rocks at the\nsouth end of Route 2.{be01}\nFolks say there's a slot in it, the\nsize of a ring or a band.{be01}\nThe last one who went looking\nnever came back.
Efu_Text_ClerkHintNone = Quiet day. Nobody's died here yet.\nStay alive out there.
Efu_Text_ClerkGreet = What'll it be?
Efu_Text_ClerkShop = Buy and sell
Efu_Text_ClerkBye = Come back alive. I mean it.
Efu_Text_DayCareQuest = I'm the Day-Care Lady. Or I was.{be01}\nA scavenger called Billy took the\nchildcare centre next door.{be01}\nHe keeps Pokémon chained up in there\nand sells them on.{be01}\nDrive Billy out, and I'll move in with\nyou and raise your Pokémon.
Efu_Text_DayCareJoined = You drove Billy out? Thank you!\nThose poor things are free now.{be01}\nI'll set up at your base, and still come\nout here to take in Pokémon.{be01}\nYou collect them at the base. Each time\nyou come back, they'll be a bit stronger.
Efu_Text_GateGuide = Past Route 3, the gangs own\nthe roads.{be01}\nWhen they're safe, I'll take you.
Efu_Text_GateGuideFree = You beat Burgh? Maybe there's still\njustice in the world.{be01}\nThe roads aren't safe yet.\nBut when they are, I'll take you.
Efu_Text_BurghIntro = I used to paint this forest.\nNow I guard what's left of it.{be01}\nEveryone hates bugs, but we've\nsurvived everything Unova threw at us.{be01}\nI'll survive you, too.{be01}\nYou'll make a nice slave, like the\nguide over there. Tough as you are!
Efu_Text_BurghBeaten = Ha... You really are something.{be01}\nHere. I found this in the trees.\nTake it, just don't kill me.
Efu_Text_BurghReward = You received {ff00:2}{0109:0}{ff00:0}!
Efu_Text_BurghLeave = Bugs don't belong at the top.\nI'll exist out of sight.{be01}\nLook after this place for me.
Efu_Text_ZoneCleared = Burgh is beaten, and the forest's\nheart is free.{be01}\nThat's as far as the first zone goes,\nfor now. Congratulations!{be01}\nThe guide at the gate is free to lead\nyou farther, in a later release.
Efu_Text_GuideMeet = Another survivor? You came out of\nthe old warehouses, right?{be01}\nI used to guide travelers from the\ngate there. I know every road.{be01}\nI'll set up at the gate again.\nFind me there to go farther out.
Efu_Text_BlockedDoor = A boulder blocks the way in.
Efu_Text_LockerHolds = Your locker. {0201:0} of 20 slots are in use.
Efu_Text_LockerSlot = {0109:0} x{0201:1}
Efu_Text_LockerStore = Store everything
Efu_Text_LockerClose = Close
Efu_Text_LockerWhat = {ff00:2}{0109:0}{ff00:0}: take one,\nor sell one for ${0201:1}?
Efu_Text_LockerTake = Take
Efu_Text_LockerSell = Sell
Efu_Text_LockerCancel = Cancel
Efu_Text_LockerBagFull = Your Bag has no room for that.\nGive an item to a Pokémon or store it first.
Efu_Text_LockerNoSale = Nobody would pay for that.
Efu_Text_LockerStoredFull = Stored {0201:0}. The locker is full,\nso {0201:1} didn't fit.
Efu_Text_LockerNothing = There's nothing to store.
Efu_Text_PaidExitAsk = A driver is idling by the old gate.{be01}\n"Back to the coast? ${0204:0}.\nFuel costs more than lives now."
Efu_Text_PaidExitGo = "Get in. Keep your head down, and\ndon't look at what's in the back."
Efu_Text_TinkerHmAsk = Is that a blank HM? Haven't seen one\nin years.{be01}\nI can still write a move onto it.\nWhich one do you want?
Efu_Text_TinkerStrength = Strength
Efu_Text_TinkerCut = Cut
Efu_Text_TinkerNotNow = Not now
Efu_Text_TinkerHmDone = There. Good as new, or better.
Efu_Text_TinkerReceived = You received {ff00:2}{0109:0}{ff00:0}!
Efu_Text_TinkerBagAsk = That Bag of yours barely holds a thing.\nI can rework it to carry three items.{be01}\nIt'll cost you ${0204:0}. Deal?
Efu_Text_TinkerBagDone = Give me a minute...\nThere. Try not to tear the seams.
Efu_Text_TinkerBagUpgraded = Your Bag can now carry three items!
Efu_Text_TinkerBagPoor = You're short on money.\nCome back when you've got it.
Efu_Text_TinkerBagNo = Suit yourself. I'll be here.
Efu_Text_TinkerChat = If it's broken, I can fix it.\nIf it isn't, I can make it better.
Efu_Text_TinkerGreet = Another customer? Down here?\nWhat do you need?
Efu_Text_TinkerWork = Business
Efu_Text_TinkerTalk = I built engines for the ferries,\nbefore the ships left without us.{be01}\nNow I patch Bags and write moves\nonto blank HMs. Scavengers carry\nthem sometimes. Bosses, mostly.{be01}\nBring me one and I'll make it\nStrength or Cut.
Efu_Text_RanchBossIntro = This ranch is mine now. The cattle,\nthe barn, the farmhands. All of it.{be01}\nThe ones who wouldn't work are\nbehind the barn. Want to join them?
Efu_Text_RanchBossBeaten = Tch... You hit harder than you look.{be01}\nFine. Take this shiny thing and get\nout of my sight. I'll find another ranch.
Efu_Text_RanchBossReward = You received {ff00:2}{0109:0}{ff00:0}!
Efu_Text_GuideCaged = Hey! Over here! Burgh's bugs wove\nme in here.{be01}\nHe's selling me off at the\nnext market.{be01}\nI can't cut through this stuff.\nBeat him, and the webs will give!
Efu_Text_GuideFreed = The webs are falling apart!\nYou actually beat Burgh?{be01}\nNobody's ever come back for\nme before. I owe you my life.{be01}\nI'll head back to the gate and\nset up there again.{be01}\nFind me there to go farther out.
Efu_Text_LockKey = The door is locked.\nIt takes the {ff00:2}{0109:0}{ff00:0}.
Efu_Text_LockOpen = You unlocked the door with\nthe {ff00:2}{0109:0}{ff00:0}.
Efu_Text_LockUsed = You used up the {ff00:2}{0109:0}{ff00:0}\nto unlock the door.
Efu_Text_GrottoDoctorIntro = Keep your voice down!{be01}\nThe scavengers dragged off everyone\nelse from my clinic. I hid down here.{be01}\nI'm a doctor. Medicine's worth more\nthan people now. Prove you're worth\nmine!
Efu_Text_GrottoDoctorHeal = Hm. You'll live.\nHold still, this won't take long.
Efu_Text_GrottoDoctorDone = There. Your team's patched up.{be01}\nI'll find another hole before the\nscavengers sniff this one out.\nStay alive.
Efu_Text_GrottoBrokerIntro = Psst. Quiet. The scavengers took my\nstall, so I trade from down here now.{be01}\nRare goods. Don't ask where they\ncame from. What'll it be?
Efu_Text_GrottoBrokerCandy = Rare Candy  $3000
Efu_Text_GrottoBrokerPPUp = PP Up  $3000
Efu_Text_GrottoBrokerTM = Mystery TM  $5000
Efu_Text_GrottoBrokerNo = No thanks
Efu_Text_GrottoBrokerSold = Pleasure doing business.\nYou never saw me.
Efu_Text_GrottoReceived = You received {ff00:2}{0109:0}{ff00:0}!
Efu_Text_GrottoBrokerPoor = No money, no deal. No exceptions.
Efu_Text_GrottoBrokerFull = Your Bag's stuffed. Make some room\nand we'll talk.
Efu_Text_GrottoBrokerBye = Your loss. I won't be here long.
Efu_Text_GrottoTraderOffer = I've been hiding down here for days.\nThe scavengers watch every way out.{be01}\nI've got a {0101:0}. Rare. Worth a\nfortune. But it's too young to fight\nmy way out.{be01}\nGive me a Pokémon of at least level\n{0201:1}, and the {0101:0} is yours. Deal?
Efu_Text_GrottoTraderWeak = That one won't get me past them.\nAt least level {0201:1}, I said.
Efu_Text_GrottoTraderDone = Finally. Strong enough to fight\nthrough them.{be01}\nTake care of the {0101:0}.\nBetter than I could down here.
Efu_Text_GrottoTraderBye = Suit yourself. I won't wait forever.
Efu_Text_GrottoTough = A wild {0101:0} lunges out of\nthe shadows!
